      "content": "i guess i've just been thinking about it from a different angle lately. if nothing in the universe actually has an inherent purpose or meaning, then life and death are basically just two different states of being, right? like, if nothing matters, then there's no logical reason why staying alive is \"better\" than not being here. it's all just... equal.",
